  title: Mine
  description: 'Dig your own Mine: walk onto the dirt at the town''s corner and hold
    Dig. Blocks are half a level tall, so you are two blocks tall. Down reaches the
    next layer (new ores, harder rock); along the cliff stays in a layer. Flecks
    and the Tap button show where the ore is. Climb out by digging stairs.'
  plannedPhase: 
  siteId: site.mine
